---
expect: reject
mentions: memory/workflow/notes.txt — memory/ 트리는
---

# Stray file that is not markdown

The rule is "memory.md only", not "markdown only", so a `.txt` under `memory/`
is a violation too. The guard's walk is `find memory -type f`, with no name
filter — narrowing it to `-name '*.md'` is a one-word edit that looks like a
tightening and is not.

The destination keeps its real extension. Only the at-rest name carries
`.fixture`.
